title Asset Link Deletion Business Process

actor Prosumer
participant Camunda
participant VPPaaS
participant Kong
participant "AssetLink Service" as Service
participant "Telemetry Service" as Telemetry
participant Kafka
participant Database

Prosumer->Camunda: Fill deletion data\n(assetLinkID)
Camunda->VPPaaS: Request Asset Link Deletion
activate VPPaaS
VPPaaS->VPPaaS: Verify if deletion is possible\n(promise: true/false)

alt promise = true
  VPPaaS-->Camunda: Promise
  Camunda->Prosumer: Confirm deletion order\n(accept: true/false)
  Prosumer->Camunda: Submit decision

  alt accept = true
    Camunda-->VPPaaS: Accept
    VPPaaS->Kong: DELETE /AssetLink/{id}
    Kong->Service: Forward Delete Request
    activate Service
    Service->Database: SELECT name FROM UtilityOperator\nWHERE id = assetLink.idUtilityOperator
    Database-->Service: utilityOperatorName
    note right of Service: Reconstruct topic name:\nAssetLinkID-UtilityOperatorName\ne.g. "3-ArcoCegoLisbon"
    Service->Kafka: AdminClient.deleteTopics(topicName)
    Kafka-->Service: Topic deleted
    Service->Telemetry: DELETE /Telemetry/Consume/{topicName}
    activate Telemetry
    note right of Telemetry: Interrupts DynamicTopicConsumer thread\nKafkaConsumer closes cleanly
    Telemetry-->Service: 204 No Content
    deactivate Telemetry
    Service->Database: DELETE AssetLink record
    Database-->Service: OK
    Service-->Kong: 204 No Content
    deactivate Service
    Kong-->VPPaaS: Response
    VPPaaS-->Camunda: Declare (deleted)
  else accept = false
    Camunda-->VPPaaS: Decline
    note right of VPPaaS: Deletion cancelled - record unchanged
  end

else promise = false
  VPPaaS-->Camunda: Decline
  Camunda->Prosumer: Decide what to do next\n(retry or abort)
end
deactivate VPPaaS
